      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your data may be processed in countries outside your residence:\n\n**Data Locations:**\n• Primary: European Union (GDPR compliant)\n• Backup: United States (Firebase services)\n• Transfers: Protected by appropriate safeguards\n\n**Protection Measures:**\n• Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs)\n• Adequacy decisions where applicable\n• Regular compliance monitoring\n• User notification of any changes"
