            "value" : "The App and its original content, features, and functionality are owned by Habitto and are protected by international copyright, trademark, patent, trade secret, and other intellectual property laws.\n\nYou may not:\n• Copy, modify, or distribute the App\n• Reverse engineer or decompile the App\n• Remove or alter copyright notices\n• Use Habitto trademarks without permission\n\nUser-generated content remains your property, but you grant us a license to use it for App functionality and improvement."
