            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, HABITTO SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR:\n\n• Indirect, incidental, or consequential damages\n• Loss of profits, data, or business opportunities\n• Damages resulting from App use or inability to use\n• Third-party actions or content\n• Service interruptions or data loss\n\nOur total liability shall not exceed the amount you paid for the App, if any.\n\nThis limitation applies to all claims, whether based on contract, tort, negligence, or other legal theories."
